msgctxt "268"
msgid "Hey, what do you think you're doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Don't try to stop me! I've got no other choice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "...It's your life, your choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Oh, uh... okay. I guess no one cares whether I live or die, after all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"You know, you're pretty high maintenance for a man on the edge... Fine. "
"What's the matter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Whatever your reason, it's not worth it. Now tell me, what's the matter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Oh... Thank you for asking..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Truth be told, I'm drowning in debt. I borrowed cash from a loan shark to "
"keep my head above water, but then it all just spiraled out of control."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"I've been paying off as much as I can, but it's not even enough to keep up "
"with interest. The only way I can pay them back now is with my life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "...Literally. I just finished signing up for a life insurance plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Now all that's left is to kill myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "You know that won't work, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr "Eh? Che vuoi dire?"

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Life insurance companies don't usually pay out for suicides committed within"
" a year of the policy's start date."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Huh! So I'm as worthless dead as I am alive?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Pretty much."
msgstr "Più o meno."

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"Well, now what? If I had any money, I wouldn't have taken out those loans in"
" the first place. But if I don't pay them off, the loan sharks will kill me "
"anyway!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"If you can't pay your debt, it's time to quit. What about filing for "
"bankruptcy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Bankruptcy? I could try..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Of course, there's always a price to pay. Your credit score will be shot, "
"for starters. But it's better than getting killed, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Hey, you're right! If I die⑬I'm dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Okay, bankruptcy it is. Thanks for the tip!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"You can find out more from a bankruptcy lawyer. I think they still do free "
"consultations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Will do, thanks... By the way, how do you know so much about all this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "I used to work in a similar line of business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Lucky me. I'm Kishimoto, pleasure to meet you. Thank you for talking me "
"down, mister...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "In that case, Kiryu-san... Here. I'd like you to have this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan Royale<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto una <Color:8>Staminan Royale<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Well then, I'm going to go talk to a lawyer. Thanks again for giving me "
"hope!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"Just keep going and work harder. They won't kill you as long as you don't "
"stop paying them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Besides, the police have been clamping down on loan sharks lately, so they "
"can't actually follow through on their threats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"In that case, I guess it couldn't hurt to try... but how do you know so much"
" about all this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "I used to work in a similar line of business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Is that so? I'm Kishimoto, by the way. It's nice to meet you, mister..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "In that case, Kiryu-san... Here. I'd like you to have this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan Royale<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto una <Color:8>Staminan Royale<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"Well then, I'd better keep my nose to the grindstone. Thanks again for the "
"pep talk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Stop Him"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Leave Him Be"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "What about filing for bankruptcy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "Just keep going and work harder."
msgstr ""

